            </note>
            <note corresp="#d330-f2" n="27" xml:id="d330-f2-content">
                <p>A. Bland Calder, Commercial Attaché in China.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d330-f3" n="28" xml:id="d330-f3-content">
